    "content": "# Client check\n\nSummary of brief.md (v19):\n\n- **What it is:** Tandem is a shared workspace where a team keeps canonical files and project context in one place, while each teammate uses their own AI assistant, which reads and updates those files through a remote MCP server.\n- **Goal:** Ship a working Tandem demo at Cal Hacks 13.0, with two teammates, each in their own assistant, editing one canonical brief without losing work.\n- **Scope and owners:** In scope are a shared workspace (files, revisions, approvals) and a remote MCP server for Claude and ChatGPT. Real-time co-editing and agent-to-agent messaging are out of scope. Alex owns the MCP server.\n"
  },
