    "content": "# Project brief\n\nTandem is a shared workspace where a team keeps its canonical files and project context in one place, while each teammate keeps using their own AI assistant, which reads and updates those files through a remote MCP server. Read this brief before any other document: it explains what we are building, why, and what is deliberately out of scope for the Cal Hacks 13.0 demo.\n\n## Goal\n\nShip a working Tandem demo at Cal Hacks 13.0: two teammates, each in their own assistant, editing one canonical brief without losing work.\n\n## Scope\n\n- One shared workspace with files, revisions, and approvals.\n- A remote MCP server for Claude and ChatGPT.\n- Out of scope: real-time co-editing, agent-to-agent messaging.\n\n## Owners\n\n- MCP server: Alex\n\nTeammate note (sam): budget approved — keep this line.\n"
  },
